{"title": "Drow Magic", "pageid": 6563, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Drow_Magic", "categories": ["Racial features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Drow Magic</b> grants <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Half-Elf#Drow_half-elf\" title=\"Half-Elf\">Drow half-elves</a> access to the following <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spells</a>, which can be cast once each per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Cantrip: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights\" title=\"Dancing Lights\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/25px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/38px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/50px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/25px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights\" title=\"Dancing Lights\">Dancing Lights</a> (at character level 1)</li>\n<li>1st Level Spell: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/38px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/50px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp\